{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Grounds is a fast sci-fi FPS built around arena shooter battles against relentless enemy hordes - a clean, high-speed loop of short runs, escalating pressure, and mastery. It blends boomer shooter energy with a sci-fi setting and light roguelite structure - a solo indie action game focused on pure gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Missions</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is a short run with its own score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed mission scores add to your Overall Score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the next mission, or replay to improve your result.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress saves after each mission you complete.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runner - fast, light hits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank - slow, heavy hits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooter - keeps distance and fires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phantom - appears out of nowhere.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pistol</strong> - Low damage, limited ammo. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic Rifle</strong> - Standard damage with recoil and spread. Ammo refills when low.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser Gun</strong> - Standard damage with infinite energy and no recoil, but overheats if overused.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Gun</strong> - Standard damage with infinite energy and no recoil, but speeds up the fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Annihilator</strong> - Close-range panic button with a short recharge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chem Gun</strong> - Poisons enemies. Kills trigger after enough enemies are poisoned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeze Gun</strong> - Area control tool that locks enemies in place. Slow recharge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty Levels</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy</strong> - Relaxed and forgiving. Learn the systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medium</strong> - The intended experience. Balance and precision matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard</strong> - Deadlier enemies. Tight resources. Highest multipliers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Score</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Overall Score is ranked on two leaderboards: monthly and all-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get more score:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headshots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot fireballs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock enemies off the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the gravity gun at high speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the pistol</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid powerful weapons (chem gun, freeze gun, annihilator)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play higher missions and harder difficulty levels</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This FPS is built around clarity, speed, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit Play. Chase a better score.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hard 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351550/76347e1e9a21c5f3aea76f19af971ae7f54c4f63.jpg"},{"name":"Hard 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351550/bad852905e859ccd916b2044174c04e1bc1f238f.jpg"},{"name":"Hard 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3351550/cc81d5104ceca3bc274dc4ff859a9030e57f7e25.jpg"},{"name":"Hard 1 Blitz","path